Z||000000||aubicon||09-20-2001||02:03 AM||||i was having a problem with the clutch not engaging so i replaced the master and the slave cylinder with replacement wagner parts from the fiero store i had to completly refill the system so i used regular snap dot 3 brake fluid (new of course). now it appears that the master cylinder is not pulling fluid out of the reservoir. it was working correctly at first but then just quit pulling fluid from the reservoir. sorry for adding so many details but i just can not figure out what i am doing wrong. any help or tips would be greatly appretiated.||||reg||1
Z||000001||SLYGUY||09-20-2001||02:22 AM||||I have been having a lot of trouble even reomoving the filler cap. Was your difficult to remove?<P>I don't want to break the reservoir. How did you remove it?<P>Sly<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SLYGUYSIG.jpg"> ||||reg||1
